[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0010","text":"（甜花，有没有好好表现呢？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0020","text":"哦，那是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0030","text":"真乃酱的身边……\n好温暖……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0040","text":"躺着的感觉，太棒了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0050","text":"呵呵……\n我也是，训练结束就会迷迷糊糊的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0060","text":"……不过，难得的集训……\n我想坚持到最后……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0070","text":"甜花也……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0080","text":"……那个……\n谢谢你，甜花酱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0090","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0100","text":"本来还担心合宿能不能好好进行……\n但甜花酱不管在哪里，都跟平时一样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0110","text":"是啊，原来跟平时一样就好\n……我就放心了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0120","text":"……？\n那个，……嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0130","text":"呼哇……\n我也开始犯困了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0140","text":"到训练之前，可以一起休息一下吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_02021500_01_0150","text":"嗯……\n午睡，最棒了……"}]
